Agent Advisor is the canonical hub for three platform implementations of the
selective-routing workflow introduced by Sol Advisor
(https://github.com/DannyMac180/sol-advisor), Copyright (c) 2026 Daniel McAteer,
also MIT licensed.

The intellectual foundation carried into every platform here originates with that
project: the machine-auditable SELECTIVE ROUTE declaration, the four delivery modes
(solo, delegate, audit, full), the single-auxiliary maximum, and the five-part worker
specification. See ORIGIN.md for a per-platform account of how close each adaptation
actually is, and platforms/*/LICENSE for the notice that travels with each exported
artifact.

